// src/design/tokens.ts
// THE source of truth for the "Painel de LED" design system. Everything else
// is derived from here:
//   - src/app/tokens.css     generated by scripts/generate-tokens.mjs
//   - src/components/pdf/theme.ts   reads the same values, converted to hex
//   - src/design/__tests__/contrast.test.ts   proves the pairs clear WCAG AA
//
// This file must stay plain, erasable TypeScript with no imports: the
// generator loads it directly in Node (type stripping), and Tailwind gets the
// CSS it renders.
//
// Palette story. The band's stage backdrop is a wall of blue LED dots behind a
// red acrylic wordmark. So: a night-blue ground (the panel switched off), one
// LED blue that carries the interface, one red reserved for the wordmark and
// the primary CTA, white/grey ink, and a sepia set for the 1969 chapter.

